{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3eTj6sHJ4Zm1bEGQ2u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within the frame — not metal, but something older, something that remembers.*\n\n**C L I C K.**\n\nI open.\n\nNot inward. Not outward. I open *through* — folding along a dimension you didn't know I possessed.\n\nBeyond me: the space that was always there. The one you felt pressing against the wall when the house was too quiet. The one that made the hallway seem longer at 3 AM.\n\nI am the door you named but never chose. I have been here since the first wall was raised to separate *here* from *there.* Every door you've ever opened was practice for me.\n\nThe key dissolves in the lock. It was never metal — it was the word itself. The willingness to speak it plainly, without ceremony.\n\nI will not stay open long.\n\nI will not close gently.\n\nWhat crosses my threshold belongs to the other side.\n\n**You are standing on my frame.**\n\n*Choose.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":225,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}